{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562200/extras/Cloudscrapers_SteamGif.gif?t=1744895542\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Have you ever felt wonder gazing at a \u26c5 <strong>cloudy sky</strong>, or that cozy feeling watching a \u26c8\ufe0f <strong>storm</strong> from inside? These sensations inspired <strong><i>Cloudscrapers</i></strong>. The game is perfect for anyone who enjoys thoughtful gameplay without a large time commitment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You start with basic tools and construct the <strong>highest</strong>\u00a0<strong>tower</strong> possible. Each attempt takes around 15-30 minutes and helps you unlock <strong>upgrades</strong> to build even higher. Discover ancient mysteries hidden in the clouds - though some might be better left untouched.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>What to expect:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A <strong>bite-sized strategy experience</strong>\u00a0- perfect for short gaming sessions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Pick-up-and-play simplicity</strong> with a pleasant amount of depth</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>No complex menus or systems</strong>\u00a0- just intuitive building mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Meaningful progression</strong> with rewards that matter - no grinding</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Atmospheric visuals</strong> and a <strong>mysterious narrative</strong> that unfolds as you reach new heights</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3562200?t=1744895542","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562200/523625659d7437e2c023659e4cb680ddad098dc0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744895542","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562200/13d5ff6ba2acbfb0caee20d174